            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa yali niyoolile injelekha, mushibala shiabaGerasi, yabukaana nende abandu babili abali namadimoni, nibarulanga mubilindwa, abahalaba muno, kata omundu yesi naranyala okhubira khunjila eyo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, bayiiba nibasunga bari Obeele orie nineefwe, iwe Omwana waNyasaye? Witsile yino okhukhusaalisia induukho niyishili? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lialiho lituuli lietsimbiitsi tsinyinji nitsiayanga, ehale ninabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadimoni ako nikamusaaya, kari Noba nokhurusia, okhurume khutsie mwituuli lietsimbiitsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nakasunjila mbu Tsie. Nako nikarula nikatsia mumbiitsi, ne lola, lituuli lilamba niliminina nilikholomokha niliikhupa munyanza, nitsisishila mumatsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
